  "intro": {
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text": "Australian organisations deploying autonomous AI agents must build governance and technical controls into systems from the start.",
        "cites": [
          "eea17d1397dbb4e5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Frontier AI firms face potential mandatory model sharing with safety and security agencies under a new bipartisan report.",
        "cites": [
          "6e1f21ad7bac31cf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Meanwhile, organisations deploying agentic AI must adapt frameworks to manage the risks of autonomous multi-step actions.",
        "cites": [
          "cc15fb5ac47a095d"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Additionally, upcoming Digital Duty of Care legislation will require AI giants to prevent user harms and provide a right to sue.",
        "cites": [
          "f3cf671205f88aff"
        ]
      }
    ],
